I think you are fairly ready to make the ascension run.

Note the term *run*.

Especially be ready for the planes. I (almost) always use a crystall
ball to detect the portals, you can use the Orb for that. Just ensure
that it is charged.

Kill Pestilence and Famine with wands of death or the finger, if
you run out of charges. Note that Death can drain your max hit
points to a very low number if you are not careful.

On the astral plane, try to run, avoid fighting, if possible. Conflict
may be your best friend. Free action can be a lifesaver. Same goes
for the spell of charm monster.

Think. Act slowely.

Contrary to some other advices given here, I personally would
not drain my levels down to 20. Instead, conflict on the fire
plane sounds like the ideal solution, solars or not.

